 "description": "Feedback-image step 3/3: server-side verification of the stored bytes (reserved size, magic bytes, dimensions, pixels, SHA-256) and the conditional PENDING\u2192READY commit \u2014 bound to the reservation OWNER and lane. A wrong optional expectedSha256 is a typed CHECKSUM_MISMATCH that leaves the reservation PENDING. Employer-only: writes need project_todos:write and reads need project_todos:read, plus canonical organization/job access. Freelancer quiz access is retired. Missing, foreign, wrong-owner, and closed-window are one indistinguishable 404. No base64 anywhere \u2014 bytes travel only through the signed grant.",
